    "sub_name": "企業資源規劃-財務會計模組",
    "sub_ename": "ENTERPRISE RESOURCE PLANNING-FINANCIAL MODULE",
    "describe_ch": "ERP已經成為企業營運管理之基石，本課程講授以財務及ERP系統操作為基礎，輔以ERP系統之發展、演進、效益、財務相關、導入模式及維護等議題，設程設計可使學生具備考ERP應用人才證照之能力。",
    "describe_eh": "ERP is the foundation of enterprises’ operation and management. This course is based on enterprise financial practice and ERP system demonstration and assisted by ERP evolution and development, its benefits, assessment during financial process, implementation model, maintenance and etc.",
